      <p source="#source-615-980"><seg source="#source-615-660">私しが土佐に帰りたりときくと、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-660-684"><rb>幕吏</rb><rt>ゑどやく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-684-690">が大</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-690-708"><rb>恐</rb><rt>おそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-708-980">れぞ、はやきおもみ申候。四方の浪人らがたずねてきて、どふもおかしい。近日京ニ後藤庄次郎どのおらんと思ひ候。其時ハ伏見の寺田やでやどかり、伏見奉行をおそれさしてやろふとぞんじおり候。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-980-1252"><seg source="#source-980-1016">何かさしあげ度候得ども、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1016-1046"><rb>鳥渡</rb><rt>（ちよつと）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1046-1061">これなく白</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-1067-1118"><seg source="#source-1061-1067">がね</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1091-1103">（金巾）</seg></note></seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-1121-1169"><seg source="#source-1118-1121">き</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1142-1154">（ママ）</seg></note></seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-1178-1232"><seg source="#source-1169-1178">ひとき</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1205-1217">（一匹）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-1232-1252">さしあげ候。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1252-1332"><seg source="#source-1252-1273">御めしものニ被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1273-1285">レ</note><seg source="#source-1285-1332">成候得バ、ありがたし。かしく。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1332-1391" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-1353-1391"><seg source="#source-1353-1365">四月七日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1365-1391" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1383-1391">龍馬</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
